      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Cloverly Master Plan, born from the 1993 General Plan Refinement, maps the area as part of the Agriculturally, Residential, and Suburban Wedges.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://montgomeryplanning.org/planning/communities/east-county/cloverly/",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Cloverly blends farms, rural neighborhoods, historic African‑American districts, suburban subdivisions, and commercial zones amid parks, creating a distinctly suburban‑rural feel.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://montgomeryplanning.org/planning/communities/east-county/cloverly/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Within Cloverly, 32 places of worship span Christian, Ahmadi Muslim, and Jain traditions, reflecting the town’s diverse spiritual fabric.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
